      "He won't settle tonight unless I sing, so I sing. The one my mother sang. I changed the words. I needed them to be true down here."
     ],
     "vo": "evelyn_1be950c7e3"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "EVELYN (TAPE)",
      "(softly) Little light, little light, hold the line through the night. If the dark calls your name — it is not me."
     ],
     "vo": "evelyn_dda7532c70"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "EVELYN (TAPE)",
      "(softly) Little light, little light, I'll be the voice you know. Signal and answer, and home we go."
     ],
     "vo": "evelyn_12b814bcf9"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "EVELYN (TAPE)",
      "I only ever sing it in here. Never near a set. Never on a channel. It keeps everything that goes over the air, and I won't give it this."
     ],
     "vo": "evelyn_0b1869a361"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "EVELYN (TAPE)",
      "If it ever calls him in my voice, it won't know the words. That's the point. That's the whole point."
     ],
     "vo": "evelyn_011dfdb3ac"
    }
   ]
