  },
  {
   "steps": [
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "OSTROWSKI (92.3 MHz, 1998)",
      "Good evening, sublevel three. This is Bram, and this is the only request show broadcast from under a mountain."
     ],
     "vo": "ostrowski_49458e137d"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "OSTROWSKI (92.3 MHz, 1998)",
      "One record tonight, requested by the canteen crew, for a certain young man who turned one in August. You know who you are, Danny."
     ],
     "vo": "ostrowski_acf7d724b4"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "OSTROWSKI (92.3 MHz, 1998)",
