     "vo": "mira_7d8da0c040"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "DANIEL",
      "I hear you. Mira, I hear you. My name's Daniel Arlen. I'm a contractor. I'm on the residential level."
     ],
     "vo": "daniel_6b0b2ea72a"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "MIRA (96.1 MHz)",
      "You can— you can actually hear me? Not an echo, not a— you're answering. You're answering me."
     ],
     "vo": "mira_0f93efb524"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "DANIEL",
      "I'm answering. Where are you?"
     ],
     "vo": "daniel_27ca1e8fbe"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "MIRA (96.1 MHz)",
      "Four. Containment. On the wrong side of the bulkhead. I can't get through it, and the lift won't come down for me any more."
     ],
     "vo": "mira_06bd682735"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "DANIEL",
      "Then I'll come to you. Northline sent me to fix the uplink. Mira, this place has been dark for twenty-eight years."
     ],
     "vo": "daniel_d838f34213"
    },
    {
     "command": "wait",
     "args": [
      "1.5"
     ]
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
